sequenceDiagram
    %% SD2 - Discover events on the homepage
    %% Stories: 4, 46, 47, 48
    %% Description: A visitor sees popular upcoming events and a calendar view; a logged-in user also gets events recommended from their preferences; clicking an event opens its page.
    actor VI as Visitor
    participant U as User
    participant GE as Genre
    participant ET as EventType
    participant EV as Event

    VI->>EV: open homepage
    EV-->>VI: popular upcoming events and calendar view [46, 47]
    opt visitor is logged in [4]
        VI->>U: show recommended events
        U->>GE: getUpcomingEvents() for each preferred genre
        U->>ET: getUpcomingEvents() for each preferred event type
        GE->>EV: findUpcoming(genre)
        ET->>EV: findUpcoming(eventType)
        U-->>VI: recommended events
    end
    VI->>EV: click an event [48]
    EV-->>VI: event page
